  "text": "Quality Veterinary Care in in Wilmington, NC | Eastern Carolina Veterinary Medical Center\nSkip to Primary Content\nContact Us\nContact Us\nMap\n50 Greenville Ave,\nWilmington,\nNC,\n28403\nCall\n(910) 790-1070\nEmergency Care\nEmergency Care\nPhone:\n(910) 790-1070\nAddress:\n50 Greenville Ave,\nWilmington,\nNC,\n28403\nCareers\nDonate Today\nAbout Us\nAbout Us\nOur Team\nJoin Our Team\nWhat is a Specialist?\nRelocation Updates\nServices\nView all Services\nEmergency Care\nCritical Care\nGrief Counseling\nInternal Medicine\nMedical Oncology\nNeurology\nSocial Work\nSports Medicine & Rehabilitation\nSurgery\nTotal Hip Replacement (THR)\nPet Owners\nFor Pet Owners\nPayment Policy\nPrescription Refill Request\nSocial Work\nFor Veterinarians\nFor Veterinarians\nReferral Portal\nSubscribe to Our Newsletter\nEmergency Care\nContact Us\nAbout Us\nEastern Carolina Veterinary Medical Center\nis proud to be\nWilmington’s only 24/7 emergency veterinary hospital\n, serving pets and their families across the region with round-the-clock emergency and specialty care. With over\n26,000 patient visits each year\n, our hospital has become a trusted leader in advanced veterinary medicine, known for our compassionate approach and commitment to excellence.\nFounded by\nDr. Williams\n, our board-certified expert in\nsports medicine, rehabilitation, and surgery\n, Eastern Carolina Veterinary Medical Center began with a vision to offer pets in Eastern North Carolina the same high level of medical expertise available at top-tier human hospitals. What started as a specialty-focused practice has since grown into a thriving, full-service referral and emergency hospital.\nToday, our dedicated team includes 115+ veterinary professionals and 17 experienced doctors, all working together under one roof to provide collaborative, comprehensive care. Whether it’s a late-night emergency or a complex concern, we’re here to support pets through every stage of healing.\nWe are continuously growing—adding new services, expanding our team, and enhancing our facility—to better serve our referring veterinarians, clients, and most importantly, the pets who depend on us.\nAt Eastern Carolina Veterinary Medical Center, your pet’s health is our passion, and we are honored to be part of their journey.\nEastern Carolina Veterinary Medical Center\n50 Greenville Ave\nWilmington\n,\nNC\n28403\nT:\n(910) 790-1070\nF:\n(910) 790-9669\nHours of Operation\nMain Hours\nMon\nOpen 24 hrs\nTue\nOpen 24 hrs\nWed\nOpen 24 hrs\nThu\nOpen 24 hrs\nFri\nOpen 24 hrs\nSat\nOpen 24 hrs\nSun\nOpen 24 hrs\nEmergency care is available 24/7. Specialty services are available by appointment.\nContact Us\nOur Team\nServices\nFor Veterinarians\nCareers\nTerms & Conditions\nPrivacy Policy\nSMS PRIVACY POLICY\nAccessibility\nCookie Preferences\nDo Not Sell or Share My Information\n©\nCopyright\n2026",
